# 18. Software Boot Process

1. Raspberry Pi boots.
2. Linux starts.
3. Network initializes.
4. Database loads.
5. FastAPI starts.
6. AI Core loads.
7. Voice Engine starts.
8. Camera Engine starts.
9. Hologram Renderer starts.
10. Plugin Manager loads plugins.
11. Remote API becomes available.
12. Wake Word Detection begins.

