# Software Summary

HoloJARVIS software is a modular AI platform that combines artificial intelligence, voice interaction, computer vision, holographic rendering, computer automation, and remote access into a single integrated system. Built around FastAPI and Raspberry Pi 5, the architecture is designed to be scalable, maintainable, and extensible, enabling HoloJARVIS to evolve from a personal holographic assistant into a complete AI operating companion capable of managing multiple computers, generating software, performing research, and executing intelligent workflows through natural language.
